<v Chris>No, I invite certain ones.
<v Chris>不，我只邀请了某些人。

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.260
<v Dave>Certain?
<v Dave>某些？

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:43.150
<v Chris>Certain--
<v Chris>某些——

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.100
<v Dave>Which certain ones do invite up to your room?
<v Dave>你邀请了哪些人到你的房间？

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:46.590
<v Chris>Room--
<v Chris>房间——

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:50.840
<v Dave>I invite certain friends up to my room.
<v Dave>我邀请了某些朋友到我的房间。

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.870
<v Dana Chivvis>Or for Chris's vaping habit--
<v Dana Chivvis>或者关于克里斯的电子烟习惯——

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:54.850
<v Dave>What's the flavor?
<v Dave>是什么口味？

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:58.710
<v Chris>This flavor is the milk inspired by Momofuku.
<v Chris>这个口味是受Momofuku启发的牛奶味。

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:04.180
<v Dave>Ugh-- this fucking vaping-- it's the end of the world and it's--
<v Dave>呃——这该死的电子烟——这是世界末日，而且——

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:14.840
<v Dana Chivvis>Chris, on the other hand, comes across as a sweet docile kind of dope who finds subtle ways to subvert Dave's alpha maleness. Like on episode 15, it's as easy as the word toodles.
<v Dana Chivvis>另一方面，克里斯表现得像个甜美温顺的瘾君子，他总能找到微妙的方法来颠覆戴夫的雄性领袖气质。比如在第15集，就像“再见”（toodles）这个词一样简单。

