<v Chris>OK, toodles.
<v Chris>好了，再见（toodles）。

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.950
<v Dave>No, no, no, we don't say toodles.
<v Dave>不不不，我们不说toodles。

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:21.610
<v Dana Chivvis>Which Dave hates, so Chris starts saying it at the end of every show.
<v Dana Chivvis>戴夫讨厌这个词，所以克里斯开始在每集结尾都说。

